erve the card's full content: element 5 \"Oral | Spironolactone | Oral · 50 mg | Last dose 0m ago\". So the card now shows only \"Last dose 0m ago\", no \"Due 11:00 PM\". There is still an 11:00 PM spironolactone dose upcoming today. If the card is supposed to show the *next due* dose (looked up across all the day's schedule slots), it should show \"Due 11:00 PM\".\n\nHmm! T", "truncated": true}
